    nightwatch:{title:'The Night Watch',meta:'Rembrandt van Rijn \u00b7 1642 \u00b7 Oil on canvas \u00b7 363 \u00d7 437 cm \u00b7 Rijksmuseum, Amsterdam',
      boxes:[
        {l:'Physical reality',v:'One of the largest canvases in the Rijksmuseum. The original was larger \u2014 cut on all sides in 1715 to fit a new space. A copy made before the cut shows what was lost.'},
        {l:'Key technique',v:'Theatrical chiaroscuro with careful layered glazes. The central figures in yellow and black are painted with full impasto; peripheral figures fade into shadow through increasingly thin application.'},
