    starrynight:{title:'The Starry Night',meta:'Vincent van Gogh \u00b7 1889 \u00b7 Oil on canvas \u00b7 73.7 \u00d7 92.1 cm \u00b7 MoMA, New York',
      boxes:[
        {l:'Physical reality',v:'73.7 \u00d7 92.1 cm \u2014 modest in size. Painted from memory and imagination while in Saint-Paul-de-Mausole asylum, not from direct observation.'},
        {l:'Key technique',v:'Extremely thick directional impasto. The visible brushstrokes are structural, creating rhythmic lines that translate the physical energy of looking into visible gesture.'},
