        {l:'Counterintuitive fact',v:'Venus\'s anatomy is deliberately non-naturalistic: her neck is too long, her shoulder impossibly sloped. This is not incompetence \u2014 Botticelli was a superb anatomist. The idealisation is Neoplatonic: Venus is a philosophical concept.'},
