    schoolofathens:{title:'School of Athens',meta:'Raphael \u00b7 1509\u20131511 \u00b7 Fresco \u00b7 approx. 770 \u00d7 500 cm \u00b7 Vatican, Stanza della Segnatura',
      boxes:[
        {l:'Physical reality',v:'Approximately 770 \u00d7 500 cm fresco, painted on the curved wall when Raphael was 26-28 years old.'},
        {l:'Key technique',v:'Linear perspective organised around a single vanishing point positioned exactly at the gap between Plato and Aristotle\'s hands \u2014 the geometric and philosophical centres are identical.'},
